+### Long-poll endpoint discovery
+
+Set `'ydb.sdk.enable_long_poll': true` to long-poll the bootstrap endpoint. New calls switch to the replacement while calls already in flight finish on their original channels. Legacy endpoints keep the configured periodic discovery interval.
